#: ../../tools/hubmap_tools.rst:92 5b75f054d0c3438bb00aa46f7b1c8cee
msgid ""
"**Description**: Search HuBMAP (Human BioMolecular Atlas Program) "
"published datasets by organ, assay type, or free text. HuBMAP provides "
"spatial biology and single-cell atlas datasets across 43 human organs "
"with data types including scRNA-Seq, CODEX, MALDI, LC-MS, snATAC-Seq, and"
" more. Organ codes: LK=Left Kidney, RK=Right Kidney, LI=Large Intestine, "
"SI=Small Intestine, HT=Heart, LV=Liver, LU=Lung, SP=Spleen, TH=Thymus, "
"LY=Lymph Node, BL=Bladder, PA=Pancreas, SK=Skin, BR=Brain, BM=Bone "
"Marrow, MU=Muscle."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hubmap_tools.rst:96 70c05bdc89594055b9b2789eac900776
msgid ""
"``organ`` (string) (optional) Organ code to filter by (e.g., 'LK' for "
"left kidney, 'HT' for heart, 'LV' for liver, 'LU' for lung, 'BR' for "
"brain, 'SP' for spleen). Use HuBMAP\\_list\\_organs to see all codes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hubmap_tools.rst:99 4829050c2d38445383be1cfcbe31e220
msgid ""
"``dataset_type`` (string) (optional) Filter by assay/data type (e.g., "
"'RNAseq', 'CODEX', 'MALDI', 'snATACseq', 'LC-MS', 'scRNAseq-"
"10xGenomics-v3')"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hubmap_tools.rst:102 8d1798fd439145feb418b8ca14af2022
msgid ""
"``query`` (string) (optional) Free text search across title, description,"
" and anatomy fields"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hubmap_tools.rst:105 21160f870bd3459c9a46af8b31cf963d
msgid "``status`` (string) (optional) Dataset status filter. Default: 'Published'"
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/hubmap_tools.rst:108 67981061970f47debf12e2d0cbefc746
msgid ""
